      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782224343445,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b0y"
    },
    {
      "id": "45yIbgcVaEZXuRYCSruqM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 704.3994926511482,
      "y": 1465,
      "width": 570.5322265625,
      "height": 251.1479935882681,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1919097859,
      "version": 212,
      "versionNonce": 38999462,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782224371036,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Correctness + failure handling\n• DB version field enables compare-and-swap lifecycle transitions.\n• Redis leases use TTL so abandoned sandboxes are reclaimed.\n• Reconciler repairs orchestrator-success / DB-failure mismatch.\n• Stateless routers recover through reconnect + service discovery.\n• Durable stream protects logs during consumer failure.\n• At-least-once logs are deduped by seqNo on the client.\n\nTradeoffs\n• Containers: faster + denser; VMs: stronger isolation.\n• Volumes: better interactive resume; snapshots: backup/checkpoint.\n• Stateless router: easy scale/recovery, requires sandbox continuity.",
      "fontSize": 16.743199572551205,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Correctness + failure handling\n• DB version field enables compare-and-swap lifecycle transitions.\n• Redis leases use TTL so abandoned sandboxes are reclaimed.\n• Reconciler repairs orchestrator-success / DB-failure mismatch.\n• Stateless routers recover through reconnect + service discovery.\n• Durable stream protects logs during consumer failure.\n• At-least-once logs are deduped by seqNo on the client.\n\nTradeoffs\n• Containers: faster + denser; VMs: stronger isolation.\n• Volumes: better interactive resume; snapshots: backup/checkpoint.\n• Stateless router: easy scale/recovery, requires sandbox continuity.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0z",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "7O2de7C9mUFw3UmrKLZTL",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 1439.902535456469,
      "width": 829.1534835915492,
